 "name_en": "Automation of Order-to-Invoice with SAP Business Network (4A1)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Automation of Order-to-Invoice with SAP Business Network (4A1)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">For customers who act as a seller for buyers from SAP Business Network, this scope item enables the supplier integration to SAP Business Network to simplify and automate exchanging sales documents and their follow-on messages.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The following documents and functions are supported in the sales process:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Create, change, or cancel sales order (inbound message)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Send purchase order confirmation (outbound message)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Send advance shipping notification (ASN, outbound delivery message)</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- Send supplier invoice (outbound message)</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create, update, or cancel sales order from purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display sales order (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release or cancel sales order manually if customer-expected price check fails</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send order (cancellation) confirmation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute picking</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issue</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send advance shipping notice</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create billing document</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Send invoice</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Experience greater automation in exchanging sales documents with buyers from SAP Business Network</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce time and manual efforts in corresponding with buyers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase productivity, performance, and work satisfaction of sales professionals and accounts receivable accountants</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Save costs for paper, postage, mailing, records management</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable greater scalability with process efficiency gains</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP Business Network 的订单到发票自动化 (4A1)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">对于充当来自 SAP Business Network 的采购商的卖方的客户，此范围项目使供应商能够集成到 SAP Business Network，以简化和自动化交换销售凭证及其后续消息。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">销售流程中支持以下凭证和功能：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 创建、更改或取消销售订单（入库消息）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 发送采购订单确认（出库消息）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 发送提前装运通知（ASN，出库交货消息）</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">- 发送供应商发票（出库消息）</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据采购订单创建、更新或取消销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示销售订单（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">如果客户预期价格检查失败，则手动下达或取消销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发送订单（取消）确认</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行拣配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账发货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发送提前装运通知</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建开票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发送发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiocb1c123b5fce4054bcc1846abe630fc9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在与 SAP Business Network 的采购商交换销售凭证时体验更大的自动化</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少与采购商相对应的时间和手动工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高销售专家和应收账款会计人员的生产力、绩效和工作满意度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">节省纸张、邮费、邮寄、记录管理成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高流程效率，提高可扩展性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
